#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/reference-architecture-index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Mattermost reference architectures describe recommended deployment "
"patterns and system designs that ensure secure, scalable, and resilient "
"collaboration. These frameworks serve as a guide for implementing "
"Mattermost at scale across a range of operational scenarios."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 참조 아키텍처는 안전하고 확장 가능하며 회복탄력적인 협업을 보장하는 "
"권장 배포 패턴과 시스템 설계를 설명합니다. 이 프레임워크는 다양한 운영 "
"시나리오 전반에서 OKR.BEST를 대규모로 구현하기 위한 가이드 역할을 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/reference-architecture-index.rst:15
msgid ""
":doc:`Application Architecture </deployment-guide/reference-architecture"
"/application-architecture>` - An overview of Mattermost's architecture "
"and components."
msgstr ""
":doc:`애플리케이션 아키텍처 </deployment-guide/reference-architecture"
"/application-architecture>` - OKR.BEST의 아키텍처와 구성 요소 개요입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/reference-architecture-index.rst:16
msgid ""
":doc:`Scaling Architecture </administration-guide/scale/scaling-for-"
"enterprise>` - Reference architecture for high availability, clustering, "
"and enterprise-scale deployments."
msgstr ""
":doc:`확장 아키텍처 </administration-guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise>` - "
"고가용성, 클러스터링, 엔터프라이즈급 배포를 위한 참조 아키텍처입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/reference-architecture-index.rst:17
msgid ""
":doc:`Deployment Scenarios </deployment-guide/reference-architecture"
"/deployment-scenarios/deployment-scenarios-index>` - Reference "
"architectures tailored for specialized Mattermost deployment scenarios."
msgstr ""
":doc:`배포 시나리오 </deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-"
"scenarios/deployment-scenarios-index>` - 특수 OKR.BEST 배포 시나리오에 맞춘 "
"참조 아키텍처입니다."

